## Problem

An agent trying to populate mixed slide slots follows grid_cell_support:true and builds a diagram cell that generation cannot draw. The engine exits with unknown svggen type, forcing a separate whole-slide/native-placeholder layout. Machine discovery contradicts the documented placement restriction.

## Steps to Reproduce

Reproducible inputs, outputs, and screenshots are preserved in tests/quality/results/layout-composition-20261002/. The report maps this finding to the exact evidence.

/tmp/json2pptx-review generate --json .claude/review-evidence/2026-10-02-layout-composition/split-engine/pestel-grid.json --output /tmp/pestel-grid-repro

## Actual Behavior and Evidence

