## Root Cause

diagramPlacementRegistry sets GridCellPipeline="svg" on every native type even though svggen has removed native implementations. ApplyPlacementMetadata derives true directly from that nonempty string; it neither checks actual SVG registration nor IsGridNativeDiagram. SWOT/five-forces recently gained native bounded grid dispatch, but metadata still calls them SVG.

