## Expected Behavior

- Derive reported placement support and pipeline from actual renderer dispatch/registration: unsupported grid types expose false/absent grid support and no SVG placement; SWOT/five-forces expose native_ooxml.
- get_diagram_capabilities, placement-aware recommendation and input validation share the corrected contract, so a requested unsupported slot is diagnosed before generation with a supported alternative.
- A render-backed placement parity test covers every advertised native type plus panel aliases; a true advertised placement must generate a short valid fixture via its advertised pipeline.

