## Problem

The recommended DeckSpec flow authorizes one kind per full slide. An author can choose alternate presentations of that kind but cannot arrange chart, stat, timeline, image and table children into spatial slots. A working mixed slide requires rewriting it as raw_json2pptx, leaving normal typed field discovery, validation and semantic repair paths.

## Steps to Reproduce

Reproducible inputs, outputs, and screenshots are preserved in tests/quality/results/layout-composition-20261002/. The report maps this finding to the exact evidence.

