## Root Cause

SlideSpec has one Kind+Body; VisualPlan selects one pattern/layout; compile dispatches one per-kind compiler per slide. compositionFields are just string pattern/layout overrides restricted to compositionCandidates for that same kind. No typed region/child model is present. The raw escape preserves arbitrary compose but maps the entire raw slide coarsely to slides[N].slide.

