## Problem

The same native DiagramSpec that renders in a body placeholder fails inside a region for ten canonical types and three aliases. Some visual arrangements have named-pattern alternatives, so this is native payload/placement parity, not a claim that every framework layout is impossible.

## Steps to Reproduce

Reproducible inputs, outputs, and screenshots are preserved in tests/quality/results/layout-composition-20261002/. The report maps this finding to the exact evidence.

/tmp/json2pptx-review generate --json .claude/review-evidence/2026-10-02-layout-composition/split-engine/pestel-compose.json --output /tmp/pestel-compose-repro

## Actual Behavior and Evidence

