- {"path": ".claude/review-evidence/2026-10-02-layout-composition/split-engine/native-grid-sweep.json", "observed": "Missing bounded dispatch affects all canonical native types and aliases listed in affected."}

## Root Cause

GenerateGridNativeDiagramXML/IsGridNativeDiagram implement only SWOT and five-forces. Other native renderers are dispatched only from body-placeholder media processing. Raw compose diagram leaves become diagram cells, so they hit the same missing bounded dispatch; enlarging a slot never fixes unknown SVG type.

